# Homebrew formula for `brew install KasprowiczM/tap/ascendo`.
#
# Created in M5 (macOS) but published to a separate repo:
#   github.com/KasprowiczM/homebrew-tap (repo name MUST start with "homebrew-")
#
# Auto-bumped on release by .github/workflows/release.yml using
# `dawidd6/action-homebrew-bump-formula` action.
#
# This folder mirrors the formula source for review/CI; the actual tap
# is its own repo per Homebrew convention.
